          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "<p>Introducing our first-ever bourbon collaboration with our friends over at Pursuit Distilling Co. This two barrel selection is a very limited release - with only 438 bottles made. <\/p><p><br\/><strong>TRUE is not licensed to sell alcohol, you must complete your bourbon purchase on the official website at shop.pursuitdistilling.com.<\/strong><\/p>",
