      "blocks": {
        "text_block_hCUEjJ": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "",
            "text": "<p>Golf and a great bourbon have several things in common. They both take time. They are best enjoyed outdoors. And most importantly - they bring people together.<\/p><p><\/p><p><br\/>Junior golf buddies turned college roommates and now company founders came together to bring you something special, rooted in camaraderie. Ryan Moore and Andres Gonzales have shared more than a few rounds together - but this might be their best yet.<\/p><p><\/p><p><\/p><p><\/p><p><br\/>Introducing the TRUE x Pursuit Distilling Dead Golfer, Bottled in Bond, 100 Proof Bourbon. Crafted by the team at Pursuit, hand selected by the team at TRUE. <\/p>",
            "link": "",
            "button_text_1": "Shop Bourbon",
            "button_link_1": "",
            "button_type_1": "primary",
            "button_text_2": "",
            "button_link_2": "",
